    },
    "atom::8b5862cb9d925c92bff35c90": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8b5862cb9d925c92bff35c90",
      "source_handle": "P0084",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "PDAC表现出严重的局部和全身免疫抑制，导致其难以治疗且预后差。目前缺乏对肠道微生物组如何介导这种免疫逃逸机制的全面理解。本研究试图梳理现有文献，明确肠道微生物组在PDAC免疫调节中的具体作用路径及其对临床治疗的潜在意义。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7781dfd33d8f7ba8a885511550d930fb61383e4ddfa2c259370565fc5382e26",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6b392e843d0ba227d5ddb03da5a396057941a2acb262028a81e98e9ba15fc1bf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bcbdac122f2782fca98cdfe8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bcbdac122f2782fca98cdfe8",
      "source_handle": "P0084",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "胰腺导管腺癌（PDAC）患者及小鼠模型中的肠道微生物组、肿瘤微环境免疫浸润及全身免疫反应。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7781dfd33d8f7ba8a885511550d930fb61383e4ddfa2c259370565fc5382e26",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::059d4c62d9220c6e49cc81a9fbdfc3b9df0ce31c05cd21342bcce43808fadbe6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9b48ec5722048d029d69dd91": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9b48ec5722048d029d69dd91",
      "source_handle": "P0084",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在阐明肠道微生物组如何调节胰腺导管腺癌（PDAC）的局部和全身免疫反应。文章指出PDAC具有强烈的免疫抑制特性，而肠道微生物组作为最大的免疫器官，通过影响外周血免疫细胞群和肿瘤内微生物组成，进而改变肿瘤微环境中的免疫浸润。研究重点在于揭示这一过程中的具体机制，包括Th17/IL-17通路、巨噬细胞极化、模式识别受体（PRRs）信号传导以及细菌易位等，并探讨了这些机制对PDAC化疗和免疫治疗疗效的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::d7781dfd33d8f7ba8a885511550d930fb61383e4ddfa2c259370565fc5382e26",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::783aefb65a46ce7db4740f8d07121af78204ffd8463f10204babfc7af0ff39ff",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
