    },
    "atom::fc2e4aa56ececacf7b4fbe7a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fc2e4aa56ececacf7b4fbe7a",
      "source_handle": "P0362",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤中耐药机制及克服策略的重要参考。它系统地阐述了肠道菌群、宿主遗传特征（HLA、性别）以及肿瘤微环境代谢状态如何影响ICI疗效，并提供了大量关于联合治疗（特别是联合抗血管生成、化疗及新型靶点抑制剂）的临床证据。对于理解微生物组和宿主因素如何通过复杂的微环境网络调节ICI敏感性具有直接参考价值，同时其整理的机制分类有助于构建更全面的耐药解释模型。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e5b89272709ad2eb8bcd4f5ff8da83ec67305e35b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7af2bfffad765d0f47fe36480e49605b0a39ed1cda7b6ffa6fd307b3d6374aee",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9eda1486a04b2f09ff269b77": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9eda1486a04b2f09ff269b77",
      "source_handle": "P0362",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述涵盖多种实体瘤，不同肿瘤类型的耐药机制和微生物组构成可能存在显著差异，应用时需考虑肿瘤特异性和情境依赖性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e5b89272709ad2eb8bcd4f5ff8da83ec67305e35b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9cbe2710a4495b76f97604594614ae17f40db177ee69d9d8fc12f4d56453b663",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6d51902e6ac45ce0b92dc477": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6d51902e6ac45ce0b92dc477",
      "source_handle": "P0362",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中引用的临床试验数据多为总体人群结果，未专门分层分析肠道菌群状态对疗效的影响，因此不能直接推断菌群与特定ICI疗效的因果强度。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e5b89272709ad2eb8bcd4f5ff8da83ec67305e35b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9cbe2710a4495b76f97604594614ae17f40db177ee69d9d8fc12f4d56453b663",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::37a939282a533a5c7440a5ab": {
      "atom_id": "atom::37a939282a533a5c7440a5ab",
      "source_handle": "P0362",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "关于宿主因素（如性别、HLA）的描述较为概括，需结合其他研究确认其在特定人群中的具体贡献度。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::575a54bd02e5808098914b0e5b89272709ad2eb8bcd4f5ff8da83ec67305e35b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
