    "atom::46d68237e826a20ae646f40e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::46d68237e826a20ae646f40e",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用系统综述方法。1. 检索策略：基于PRISMA指南，在PubMed、WoS、Scopus进行文献检索，不限语言，截止日期为2025年1月。2. 纳入标准：成人mRCC患者，接受微生物组干预（抗生素、益生菌、前体、饮食、FMT）并与标准护理对比，报告ORR、PFS、OS或irAEs等临床终点。排除非比较研究、混合肿瘤类型未分层、儿科、临床前及非原创出版物。3. 质量评估：观察性研究使用纽卡斯尔-渥太华量表（NOS），RCT使用Cochrane RoB 2工具。4. 数据综合：定性综合各研究的干预措施、微生物组变化及临床结果，按干预类型（抗生素负面影响、益生菌/FMT潜在正面影响）分类叙述。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e0f1d40615e5871b5b2145c0104cfb2397ea0bcb7dba610497471924d7c336ec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bb6258bf28f71234e7b1005d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bb6258bf28f71234e7b1005d",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "首次系统汇总mRCC领域关于微生物组干预的临床证据，明确了抗生素对ICI疗效的负面关联，以及益生菌/FMT在靶向治疗和免疫治疗中的潜在增效作用。",
        "limits": "所给材料未交代具体的荟萃分析统计结果（如合并效应量），主要依赖定性综合。证据基础薄弱：包含3项回顾性研究（存在混杂偏倚风险）和3项小样本RCT/摘要（统计效能不足，其中一项仅为会议摘要）。微生物组检测方法异质性高，缺乏标准化。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1b47393f56e85cb229c89a8e189885682283138294681d54eb733f6593fa1fd6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6a3d928b5a7bb7e7256aa430": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6a3d928b5a7bb7e7256aa430",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "mRCC患者接受ICI治疗，围治疗期（ICI开始前8周至开始后4周或30天内）使用广谱抗生素",
        "finding": "抗生素暴露导致肠道菌群失调，显著降低ORR（12.9%-34.8% vs 更高比例），缩短PFS（HR 1.96-3.10）和OS（HR 3.5），增加疾病进展风险。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::039f9d801c2b4b49b466217e80e820ef8cbdf6eca90e82282d24f7a05b99a265",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9dd8c9da2bda33ccfed831a4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9dd8c9da2bda33ccfed831a4",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "mRCC患者接受VEGF-TKI治疗期间补充含动物双歧杆菌的酸奶",
        "finding": "益生菌实现100%定植，富集Akkermansia muciniphila和Barnesiella intestinihominis等有益菌属，观察到PFS延长的趋势，但未达到统计学显著差异（小样本n=20）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::039f9d801c2b4b49b466217e80e820ef8cbdf6eca90e82282d24f7a05b99a265",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4f13d094ffea1dd368bb1748": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4f13d094ffea1dd368bb1748",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "mRCC患者接受pembrolizumab + axitinib治疗，接受来自长期ICI反应者的FMT",
        "finding": "FMT组1年PFS显著高于对照组（66.7% vs 35.0%, p=0.036），ORR提高（54% vs 28%），且未增加≥3级不良事件（基于Phase II RCT摘要，n=50）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::039f9d801c2b4b49b466217e80e820ef8cbdf6eca90e82282d24f7a05b99a265",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a6c7883bc90d2043e3b56081": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a6c7883bc90d2043e3b56081",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "mRCC患者接受cabozantinib + nivolumab治疗，补充CBM588益生菌",
        "finding": "益生菌组ORR显著高于对照组（74% vs 20%），6个月PFS改善（84% vs 60%），伴随Ruminococcaceae富集和维生素K2合成通路增加，但双歧杆菌丰度本身无显著变化。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
