      "variant_group": "field::7ab2c1a2f4fac267ca43d8d8055806a445df56949ce62db6ff8926d4a8908706",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5af0683da0e8542be49997c0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5af0683da0e8542be49997c0",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "对现有研究局限性的总结：回顾性设计、小样本、方法学异质性、未控制的混杂因素（PPI、类固醇、饮食）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b4a9cd682ba1e3ae63285a229393374337b1f895b2758e3ca9806064d39f0577",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5505974317c7252b4a02f3ed": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5505974317c7252b4a02f3ed",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "指出当前领域的局限性，如微生物组检测方法的异质性、饮食/地区习惯等混杂因素的控制不足。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "2",
            "connection_to_review"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d545d806b5dea1e13f98053a70b8577abcdf0ecda66877932c4b89f106d76d18",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c19bb526eb7a615ae53133bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c19bb526eb7a615ae53133bd",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "purpose"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述的“未来方向”或“局限性”部分，强调标准化微生物组分析和大型前瞻性试验的必要性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "2",
            "purpose"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7ab2c1a2f4fac267ca43d8d8055806a445df56949ce62db6ff8926d4a8908706",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4ba7a468e5cc9bd8f1d98e49": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4ba7a468e5cc9bd8f1d98e49",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "证据主要来自mRCC，外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎；抗生素效应的证据多为回顾性，存在混杂；益生菌/FMT的证据来自小样本或摘要，尚需大规模验证。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组状态（特别是抗生素暴露导致的失调）与ICI疗效之间的强临床关联证据。具体显示围ICI期的抗生素使用显著降低ORR、PFS和OS。同时提供了FMT和益生菌在mRCC中改善PFS和ORR的初步临床试验数据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aa132256081b4953b05d0c637fca4d0a938865b6217b66a91b6a8b348fb2f250",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bc5328e367ff10e3db494e35": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bc5328e367ff10e3db494e35",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于论证肠道微生物组是ICI疗效的关键调节因子；作为“微生物组影响疗效”的临床证据部分；支持“微生物组可作为预测生物标志物”的观点（如低Akkermansia丰度预示耐药）。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fa4202120a91dd86070c9702bcebd5ee5a2e2930e74e9886f7979f6b1722e4a0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::34eae2b42189c49679e5f36c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::34eae2b42189c49679e5f36c",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制部分大量引用临床前模型（小鼠FMT恢复敏感性），临床直接证据有限；不同研究中富集的菌属和通路不一致（如CBM588未改变双歧杆菌丰度但改善了疗效），提示机制复杂性。",
        "contribution": "提供了微生物组介导ICI疗效的部分机制线索。提及共生菌（如A. muciniphila, B. fragilis）通过树突状细胞激活和CD8+ T细胞浸润增强ICI疗效；抗生素通过耗竭SCFA产生菌、促进病原生物扩张导致耐受性免疫微环境。还提到益生菌可能通过维生素K2合成通路和富集Ruminococcaceae发挥免疫调节作用。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aa132256081b4953b05d0c637fca4d0a938865b6217b66a91b6a8b348fb2f250",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7a4cc3a23770c3acf1269ca2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7a4cc3a23770c3acf1269ca2",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释“微生物组如何介导这种效应”的机制部分；提供宿主-微生物-免疫系统互作的具体分子/细胞途径示例（DC激活、T细胞浸润、SCFA、抗原模拟）。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fa4202120a91dd86070c9702bcebd5ee5a2e2930e74e9886f7979f6b1722e4a0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ce624a8fe7f9836f0032073d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ce624a8fe7f9836f0032073d",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为“肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤ICI疗效”提供了重要的临床相关性证据和机制线索。它特别有价值地连接了mRCC这一具体实体瘤模型与微生物组干预措施，提供了抗生素损害疗效的反面证据，以及益生菌/FMT增强疗效的初步正面证据。对于综述而言，它是解释“微生物组作为预测生物标志物”和“微生物组作为治疗靶点”的重要素材，特别是提供了从观察性关联到初步干预试验的证据链条。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::66bbff2b474e7c8342c4c89b693e4647d1cf5ad3308108dde1cd3a0328663dde",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4bcc98caeb15f7e1bb6dd797": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4bcc98caeb15f7e1bb6dd797",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述聚焦于mRCC，虽然机制具有普适性潜力，但临床结果不能直接外推至所有实体瘤。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86b4cc36d8a08d251ba6c08d2c97c47c500d387cc0635ff2a359e1744140a7eb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f83a4407259ef2d37b3555fb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f83a4407259ef2d37b3555fb",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "抗生素对ICI疗效的负面影响证据主要来自回顾性队列，可能存在未测量的混杂因素（如感染严重程度本身影响预后）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86b4cc36d8a08d251ba6c08d2c97c47c500d387cc0635ff2a359e1744140a7eb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2a012c725b412df699f0d322": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a012c725b412df699f0d322",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "益生菌和FMT的正面效果来自小样本RCT或会议摘要，统计效力不足，不能作为确证性证据，仅提示信号。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86b4cc36d8a08d251ba6c08d2c97c47c500d387cc0635ff2a359e1744140a7eb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7b1d00f8fcd8ab1638f045a9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7b1d00f8fcd8ab1638f045a9",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的机制（如Akkermansia的作用）多基于临床前模型或临床相关性，临床因果证据尚不充分。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86b4cc36d8a08d251ba6c08d2c97c47c500d387cc0635ff2a359e1744140a7eb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9cf23d9e0fcaca0878be814b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9cf23d9e0fcaca0878be814b",
      "source_handle": "P0090",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同研究中使用的益生菌菌株、FMT供体筛选标准、测序分析方法差异巨大，直接比较需谨慎。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b10bf15f5c5bded90fc255019d5ae523cc5976d124d8655cb8ab8283fc86e8b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::86b4cc36d8a08d251ba6c08d2c97c47c500d387cc0635ff2a359e1744140a7eb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
