    "atom::e99c317b05be378537a0ec55": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e99c317b05be378537a0ec55",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这部分内容多为理论整合和假设，直接针对这些亚型的微生物干预临床试验数据不足。",
        "contribution": "分析了HCC病因异质性（病毒性肝炎 vs NASH/MASLD）和肿瘤遗传/代谢特征如何塑造不同的微生物组景观，进而影响免疫治疗响应。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::517e243b34d82bfcfe02bf8b21ab883698d06656ba327f71844823cdefe78465",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::633898425e66f7c6483c0bd5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::633898425e66f7c6483c0bd5",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释“为何微生物标志物在不同患者亚群中表现不同”，强调个体化医疗的重要性。为分层治疗提供理论依据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "3",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::656eee092e973f6dfaca6fe88c9abc4151d6322389eef056b3143aac17015684",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5df519a21a71a583f582f1c7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5df519a21a71a583f582f1c7",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤（特别是HCC）对ICIs的疗效提供了详细的分类学和功能机制素材。它提供了具体的响应/耐药微生物标志物列表、关键的代谢介导机制（胆汁酸、SCFAs）、以及不同干预手段（FMT、益生菌、抗生素）的临床前和早期临床证据。特别有价值的是其对肿瘤异质性（病毒性vs代谢性）背景下微生物组作用的细分，有助于解释为何同一微生物标志物在不同患者群体中可能表现出不一致的效果。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f67d06c964c3124804ad6a18ce22801aa0ba587402dbf21bb071180e185ddb07",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bbf11cba6cccb153c9fcf8c2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bbf11cba6cccb153c9fcf8c2",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述聚焦于HCC，虽然机制可能在其他实体瘤中保守，但直接将HCC的微生物标志物外推至其他癌症类型需谨慎，需考虑器官特异性和肿瘤微环境的差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::42620378e805735b0d389879eb885cdad9280172f6a70b42c4b081ea6510d62b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::25f7613ff7964d5c53b4aa02": {
      "atom_id": "atom::25f7613ff7964d5c53b4aa02",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中引用的微生物分类学结果在不同研究间存在矛盾，这反映了方法学异质性和生物学复杂性，而非简单的错误。在综合时不应强行统一，而应将其视为领域内的争议点或情境依赖现象。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::42620378e805735b0d389879eb885cdad9280172f6a70b42c4b081ea6510d62b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8492d048b43cad61fbb16b3e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8492d048b43cad61fbb16b3e",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "机制描述中混合了人类临床观察和小鼠模型数据，需明确区分哪些是人类中已证实的关联，哪些是动物模型中的因果推断，避免高估人类体内的机制确定性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::42620378e805735b0d389879eb885cdad9280172f6a70b42c4b081ea6510d62b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::09539de388e741601182cc61": {
      "atom_id": "atom::09539de388e741601182cc61",
      "source_handle": "P0113",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者声称微生物组是“关键调节因子”，但这主要基于相关性研究和有限的干预试验，尚不能确立其在所有HCC患者中的决定性作用，需保留不确定性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85c46f4754526a0d83f4dd4564a98bda0d4ff03596",
          "field_path": [
