          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::483cee9428d38f345e6f9d41929223afa99229cd1c3c15dc73f4e4a4e904ba4d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bbc1b2d0b728e24fce2d9b6f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bbc1b2d0b728e24fce2d9b6f",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管肠道微生物群已知能调节全身免疫和ICI反应，但肿瘤驻留微生物群的作用仍未得到充分探索。本研究旨在回答：肿瘤内微生物群如何影响肿瘤内免疫反应和免疫治疗结果？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::79d8366a5ba02b4054038977469c5c7e16f4e5844ab836c4101b78e79b144312",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cf6ff7014f4ff58ef5648059": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cf6ff7014f4ff58ef5648059",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肿瘤内微生物群（tumor-resident microbiota）及其对实体瘤免疫反应和免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的影响。涵盖黑色素瘤、胰腺癌、食管癌、胃癌、乳腺癌、肺癌和结直肠癌等实体瘤类型。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::201ab4c146fb5a385523353cb722e75e342bc47a8dfc163a80f707e325e2c0bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a68d1eccdacc9e676227db64": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a68d1eccdacc9e676227db64",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文是一篇遵循PRISMA指南的系统综述，旨在评估肿瘤相关细菌对抗肿瘤免疫反应的影响。研究检索了2010年1月至2025年4月期间PubMed、Scopus、Web of Science和EMBASE数据库中的文献，纳入标准为表征非肠道微生物群并评估免疫终点（如T细胞浸润、细胞因子谱、PD-L1表达或ICI反应性）的研究。由于终点异质性，未进行荟萃分析。最终纳入17项研究，发现肿瘤内细菌通过三种主要机制调节免疫反应和ICI疗效：通过抗原呈递和Th1极化激活免疫；通过调节性T细胞募集和基质重塑抑制免疫；以及通过微生物信号传导调节检查点和导致T细胞耗竭。这些效应具有空间结构特征且依赖于肿瘤背景。结论认为肿瘤局部微生物群是肿瘤免疫微环境中的一个独特且可操作的组成部分，将其纳入免疫肿瘤学策略可能有助于生物标志物发现、患者分层和基于微生物组的疗法开发。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4881242c07545038aa5088dbc3e59cf4349bf8408987e5080d1918a64845efca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::52ea3a9e04f7600fdcaa2dc3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::52ea3a9e04f7600fdcaa2dc3",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "区分‘肠道微生物群’与‘肿瘤驻留微生物群’的概念，强调后者是肿瘤免疫微环境的独特组成部分。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
