        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述聚焦于‘肿瘤内’而非‘肠道’微生物群，这与用户关注的‘肠道微生物群’主题形成对比或补充。它提供了肿瘤局部微环境中微生物调节免疫的具体机制框架（Th1极化、Treg募集、T细胞耗竭），可用于解释肿瘤内部免疫抑制或激活的微环境因素，特别是当讨论肠道菌群如何通过全身循环影响肿瘤局部时，可作为局部效应的对照或机制补充。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8b3b4997afa1efe4141687c5b5560fa883f61caced974ed2fa64aa41fb6d4d40",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7fdde3f87c2b3b4bf4ef22b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7fdde3f87c2b3b4bf4ef22b5",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述关注的是‘肿瘤内’微生物，而非用户核心问题中的‘肠道’微生物。两者虽有联系，但不能直接等同。使用时需明确区分作用部位（局部肿瘤 vs 全身/肠道）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::40c7210168459061c82d02bbe071d11555b8657bc78a6d7cfaea5229cca3e8bf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c4507e6d04424622c51d60c1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c4507e6d04424622c51d60c1",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "由于未进行荟萃分析，提供的机制是定性归纳，缺乏效应大小的量化支持。在解释机制强度时需保持谨慎。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::40c7210168459061c82d02bbe071d11555b8657bc78a6d7cfaea5229cca3e8bf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ee1d9dfb4ee2c393bd63e767": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ee1d9dfb4ee2c393bd63e767",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "效应被描述为‘肿瘤背景依赖’，意味着不同癌症类型中微生物的作用可能截然不同，不可泛化为普适规律。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbebbe2c9c2a10ec113f22994a4306055a90cbc5d56",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::40c7210168459061c82d02bbe071d11555b8657bc78a6d7cfaea5229cca3e8bf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fa5328dc5fc87d2b2d71a51e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fa5328dc5fc87d2b2d71a51e",
      "source_handle": "P0457",
      "field_path": [
