    "atom::6ef9c7d596b464090047fdaf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6ef9c7d596b464090047fdaf",
      "source_handle": "P0515",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "本文是综述文章，其结论基于对已有研究的综合，而非原始实验数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::145e68ca2e945fe75d99a541fecf0169072899b02f0e06814032f4c22205ce71",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::13dfa10c3816be2a1991c428cfd929f160264877b9163bf50cd504a33bda2b06",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::caac1d9288cbd3c83470d630": {
      "atom_id": "atom::caac1d9288cbd3c83470d630",
      "source_handle": "P0515",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的机制（如SCFAs促进Treg分化）多为基于特定模型或文献的报道，实际临床效果受多种因素影响，需谨慎外推。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::145e68ca2e945fe75d99a541fecf0169072899b02f0e06814032f4c22205ce71",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::13dfa10c3816be2a1991c428cfd929f160264877b9163bf50cd504a33bda2b06",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2cd669f9b3de59085c83f213": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2cd669f9b3de59085c83f213",
      "source_handle": "P0515",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者明确指出因果关系尚未完全验证，因此在引用其机制解释时，应标注为“潜在机制”或“文献报道的机制”，而非既定事实。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::145e68ca2e945fe75d99a541fecf0169072899b02f0e06814032f4c22205ce71",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::13dfa10c3816be2a1991c428cfd929f160264877b9163bf50cd504a33bda2b06",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ea50e0d9024c7e55474aa042": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ea50e0d9024c7e55474aa042",
      "source_handle": "P0515",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "不同代谢物的作用可能存在情境依赖性（如SCFAs在某些情况下促进M2型巨噬细胞，这可能有利于组织修复但也可能抑制抗肿瘤免疫），需结合具体上下文理解。",
