    "atom::2dc8864454dd12af0d85f50c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2dc8864454dd12af0d85f50c",
      "source_handle": "P0544",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "解决结直肠癌中大多数MSS患者对ICI治疗原发性耐药的临床困境，探索通过调节肠道微生物群来增强ICI疗效的潜在机制和治疗策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::01759670cec0ae86b898b9ca771c0193c2e67ef5bb3606c1dbda10890462613d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::80ee6d0031e9d81e9747aece45c770ad293c2fc6b8d11bb4e1c369c56d2ba38f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a482d7a77cd374fe0e9a7227e8a5f004d51f1f604a5fcb26f64bff54a6858d12",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::94e811e66263ba6df8d78a76": {
      "atom_id": "atom::94e811e66263ba6df8d78a76",
      "source_handle": "P0544",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "结直肠癌（CRC），特别是微卫星稳定型（MSS）患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）的耐药问题；聚焦肠道微生物群及其代谢产物、生物活性成分在调节ICI疗效中的双重作用，以及昼夜节律的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::01759670cec0ae86b898b9ca771c0193c2e67ef5bb3606c1dbda10890462613d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::80ee6d0031e9d81e9747aece45c770ad293c2fc6b8d11bb4e1c369c56d2ba38f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::34912176940f2d6a846ebd86f0ed8efbb3afa35f831142c8309c0bfa398759ee",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::afe7ad26d480688d4c9f3392": {
      "atom_id": "atom::afe7ad26d480688d4c9f3392",
      "source_handle": "P0544",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在阐明肠道微生物群如何通过特定菌株、代谢物和生物活性成分调节宿主免疫系统，进而影响结直肠癌中ICIs的疗效。文章首先分析了有益菌和致病菌通过抗原呈递、T细胞浸润及免疫抑制细胞调控等机制对ICI反应的双向影响；其次探讨了微生物代谢物（如短链脂肪酸、色氨酸代谢物、肌苷等）作为免疫调节信使的作用；接着引入了肠道微生物群与宿主免疫细胞的昼夜节律交互概念，提出时间免疫治疗的潜力；最后综合了饮食干预、粪便微生物移植（FMT）、益生菌/益生元补充及靶向抗生素等临床转化策略，并评估了其成熟度与挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::01759670cec0ae86b898b9ca771c0193c2e67ef5bb3606c1dbda10890462613d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::80ee6d0031e9d81e9747aece45c770ad293c2fc6b8d11bb4e1c369c56d2ba38f",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::52e2d67e6b91292175dbf130f4352ff5794cdcda4d70c78973940f4c3248fc39",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::45e4d9250c21caec00f4a3d1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::45e4d9250c21caec00f4a3d1",
      "source_handle": "P0544",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤ICI疗效”这一核心问题提供了详尽的机制分类框架和临床策略评估。其价值在于将分散的菌株、代谢物和节律研究整合为一个连贯的解释体系，特别适用于构建关于微生物-免疫互作机制的综述章节，并为评估不同干预手段（FMT vs LBPs vs 饮食）的临床证据等级提供参考。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::01759670cec0ae86b898b9ca771c0193c2e67ef5bb3606c1dbda10890462613d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::80ee6d0031e9d81e9747aece45c770ad293c2fc6b8d11bb4e1c369c56d2ba38f",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c20490fe78015276fe7f3bce7998630a5ab2877290a79ac9f4182853bd195e38",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::adea10aba1e36bb84bfa3998": {
      "atom_id": "atom::adea10aba1e36bb84bfa3998",
      "source_handle": "P0544",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "多数机制证据来自小鼠模型，人类临床相关性多为相关性研究或早期试验，因果链条在人体内的确证程度不一。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效的具体生物学路径：包括通过DCs成熟、CD8+ T细胞招募/活化、Treg/M2 TAM抑制来增强抗肿瘤免疫，以及通过代谢物诱导MDSCs/Treg来抑制免疫。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::01759670cec0ae86b898b9ca771c0193c2e67ef5bb3606c1dbda10890462613d",
