    "atom::59b58b6958198ba2be6d0236": {
      "atom_id": "atom::59b58b6958198ba2be6d0236",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "这是一项单中心、前瞻性观察性研究。纳入标准为接受特定抗PD-1药物（纳武利尤单抗或帕博利珠单抗）治疗的实体瘤患者。主要干预措施为常规药物治疗，研究重点在于基线数据的采集与分析。方法学上，在PD-1抑制剂给药前收集患者粪便样本，使用超高效液相色谱-串联质谱系统定量分析fSCFA。结局指标依据RECIST 1.1标准判定客观缓解情况，将患者分为响应组（R）和非响应组（NR），比较两组间fSCFA水平的差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b6ac568ff4d3a3d525edda027062b1f9346a38a30d8c2438d0e1848b79650286",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8118b11f9d52015ed250b811": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8118b11f9d52015ed250b811",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了在实体瘤抗PD-1治疗人群中，基线粪便短链脂肪酸水平与治疗响应之间存在正相关关系的初步证据。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的统计学检验细节（如P值确切数值、置信区间）、fSCFA的具体种类（乙酸、丙酸等）及其各自的变化趋势。样本量较小（n=40），且为单中心研究，可能存在选择偏倚。未提供关于肠道微生物群落结构或其他代谢物的数据，仅聚焦于SCFA这一单一维度。无法确定因果关系，仅能说明关联性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d68fa3ee3b04075226965d2ad8a335b68f5a959a9694bfa61845a2474b5c9aae",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fc101e78cc2732fcbc075244": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fc101e78cc2732fcbc075244",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "40例实体瘤患者（黑色素瘤19例，头颈部癌7例，胃肠道癌7例，泌尿生殖系统癌4例，其他3例），总响应率为22.5%。响应者9例，非响应者31例。",
        "finding": "响应者（R）组的粪便短链脂肪酸（fSCFA）水平显著高于非响应者（NR）组（p值在摘要中未完整显示，但明确指出显著更高）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1dcb8733cca632ce6754ce2a80e506b833c5cbe1d5bc71301c426e02992c2d11",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4120b76283240cea50a8aeb9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4120b76283240cea50a8aeb9",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::940b5820d5ead244290085578168905ef7ddc6f37c1a3c7fef51639354388296",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::74e70f82c82081f03088a3f8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::74e70f82c82081f03088a3f8",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在多种癌症中有效，但其疗效存在个体差异。肠道微生物群被认为是影响ICI疗效的因素之一，但肠道微生物群与肿瘤微环境免疫状态之间的关系尚不清楚。本研究具体关注肠道微生物的主要代谢产物——短链脂肪酸（SCFAs），探讨其在抗PD-1治疗中的临床意义。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::23054e000feee850295fe1d25b95381bfc9b9382fc53e1a6985848c019fdb302",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::856964dc8d1a86bacb24ad8f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::856964dc8d1a86bacb24ad8f",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "2016年7月至2018年4月在京都大学医院接受抗PD-1抑制剂（纳武利尤单抗或帕博利珠单抗）治疗的实体瘤患者。研究对象包括黑色素瘤、头颈部癌、胃肠道癌、泌尿生殖系统癌及其他类型肿瘤，共40例。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9b991bdc5ec66b7b3343a2e3d2cb171f3e4df5e875bde1fcb621d45575208e4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::040dc30caacd5090b419382f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::040dc30caacd5090b419382f",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在评估肠道微生物代谢产物短链脂肪酸（SCFA）与实体瘤患者抗PD-1免疫治疗疗效之间的关联。研究采用前瞻性设计，收集患者在给药前的粪便样本，利用超高效液相色谱-串联质谱法分析粪便短链脂肪酸（fSCFA）水平，并根据RECIST 1.1标准将患者分为响应者（R）和非响应者（NR）。结果显示，响应者的fSCFA水平显著高于非响应者，提示fSCFA可能作为预测抗PD-1治疗疗效的生物标志物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::994cfa65fa3a56c708c36085a0ced0a7e2c90bcbaa2ed4df9c4b3139245ba173",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ffa14478b80c6999d1e3ff80": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ffa14478b80c6999d1e3ff80",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物代谢产物（特别是短链脂肪酸）与免疫检查点抑制剂疗效关联的直接实证数据。它支持“肠道微生物通过代谢产物调节ICI疗效”的假设，并提出了fSCFA作为潜在预测生物标志物的可能性。对于综述而言，它是连接微生物组成/功能与治疗临床结局的重要桥梁证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::329cc25f55fce84a6d155ae4732a742d3254bf62b32f27e21ee0c114f2af3850",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::df6638fa60cf581d1f6279f3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::df6638fa60cf581d1f6279f3",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅涉及SCFA，未涵盖其他微生物代谢物或菌群组成细节。样本量有限，且为单中心研究，外推至所有实体瘤或所有ICI药物需谨慎。不能单独证明机制，仅展示表型关联。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物代谢物（SCFA）水平与实体瘤患者抗PD-1治疗响应率相关的直接临床数据。发现响应者的fSCFA水平显著高于非响应者。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d970af47532387da7088cda5b30c14788b3c7d4cb8f7e1af61d7291aebedcb01",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cb009344742a7b3d76127a7e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cb009344742a7b3d76127a7e",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于回答“肠道微生物如何调节ICI疗效”中的相关性部分，即证明特定的微生物代谢特征与更好的临床预后相关联。可作为支持“微生物组影响免疫治疗敏感性”这一观点的证据之一。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f68b0d9a89e1cd128ccbf01a62b2ceb6f72139fbb5d426c1d42d3fa33cd701db",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::928fcccf0dd4cc0fc2e22e74": {
      "atom_id": "atom::928fcccf0dd4cc0fc2e22e74",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "摘要未提供SCFA影响免疫细胞的具体路径（如HDAC抑制、GPR受体激活等），因此不能用于详细解释分子机制，仅能作为机制研究的起点或背景支持。",
        "contribution": "虽然未深入阐述分子机制，但确立了SCFA作为中介变量的可能性，暗示微生物代谢活动可能是连接微生物群与宿主免疫反应的关键环节。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::729cb791ca6edfe6c11639b51c46bf4f218701d437768ee41c473e84618e3fc2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d970af47532387da7088cda5b30c14788b3c7d4cb8f7e1af61d7291aebedcb01",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::27dbfd425028eb21ea9ca869": {
      "atom_id": "atom::27dbfd425028eb21ea9ca869",
      "source_handle": "P0223",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "在讨论机制时，可作为“微生物代谢产物介导效应”的一个具体实例。提示后续研究应关注SCFA如何通过调节免疫细胞功能来影响ICI疗效。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
