    "atom::750f4003f9e2f3e566d3cc2d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::750f4003f9e2f3e566d3cc2d",
      "source_handle": "P0503",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述涵盖多种癌症类型（包括血液肿瘤如淋巴瘤），但用户关注实体瘤。提取证据时需严格筛选仅适用于实体瘤（如NSCLC, CRC, Melanoma, HCC, PDAC）的数据，排除仅涉及血液肿瘤的结论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::10f6f83feb179745fdb9234e2a4388e5355d3aea91f544b7672e922449f3e293",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::38bbb2b9630ad396fa05214374d1220a2f447e03a12be472b85055795bc67f34",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8a2bdf55757e485be43fde5e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8a2bdf55757e485be43fde5e",
      "source_handle": "P0503",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中强调代谢物效应的“上下文依赖性”，特别是SCFAs在不同ICI类型（PD-1 vs CTLA-4）和不同肿瘤微环境中的双向作用。解读时必须保留这种复杂性，避免单一方向的简化结论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::10f6f83feb179745fdb9234e2a4388e5355d3aea91f544b7672e922449f3e293",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::38bbb2b9630ad396fa05214374d1220a2f447e03a12be472b85055795bc67f34",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6859b34486e2b2256197ea59": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6859b34486e2b2256197ea59",
      "source_handle": "P0503",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "许多机制描述基于临床前模型（小鼠、类器官），在应用于人类临床解释时，需注明其来源限制，区分观察性关联与因果证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::10f6f83feb179745fdb9234e2a4388e5355d3aea91f544b7672e922449f3e293",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::38bbb2b9630ad396fa05214374d1220a2f447e03a12be472b85055795bc67f34",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3735241add152cdb335b4252": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3735241add152cdb335b4252",
      "source_handle": "P0503",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "抗生素对代谢物的影响是间接的（通过改变菌群），在归因时需明确是“抗生素-菌群-代谢物-疗效”链条，而非抗生素直接作用于代谢物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::10f6f83feb179745fdb9234e2a4388e5355d3aea91f544b7672e922449f3e293",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::38bbb2b9630ad396fa05214374d1220a2f447e03a12be472b85055795bc67f34",
